<title>KENYA: Kenya port unloads 60,000 T sugar over past week.</title>
<headline>Kenya port unloads 60,000 T sugar over past week.</headline>
<dateline>MOMBASA, Kenya 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some 60,000 tonnes of sugar was offloaded at Mombasa port in the past week, Kenya Ports Authority officials said on Friday.</p>
<p>They did not have total imports for the year so far.</p>
<p>One vessel carrying 10,000 tonnes of sugar from Belgium was being held at Mombasa for lack of proper documentation, they added.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
